                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <div class="table-source">Source: Backtest simulation data from April 2025 to July 2026.</div>

                <h3 class="subsection-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">4.4 Live Deployment Findings <span class="en-subtitle">/ 4.4 Live Deployment Findings</span></h3>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Sejak diluncurkan pada 9 Agustus 2026, Bot A Fase 5.2 mencatat 25 transaksi SELL berhasil dengan Win Rate 100% pada saldo awal simulasi $200. Seluruh transaksi keluar melalui mekanisme Trailing TP adaptif berbasis tier volatilitas—tanpa satu pun transaksi Stop Loss terpicu. Koin yang masuk pemantauan aktif dirotasi secara dinamis berdasarkan kondisi pasar real-time, mencerminkan kelincahan fundamental arsitektur multi-koin.
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        Since its launch on August 9, 2026, Bot A Phase 5.2 recorded 25 successful SELL transactions with a 100% Win Rate on a $200 simulation starting balance. All exit transactions occurred through the adaptive Trailing TP mechanism based on volatility tier—with zero Stop Loss transactions triggered. Coins entering active monitoring are dynamically rotated based on real-time market conditions, reflecting the fundamental agility of the multi-coin architecture.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <h3 class="subsection-title">4.5 QPS Approach Effectiveness <span class="en-subtitle">/ 4.5 QPS Approach Effectiveness</span></h3>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Transformasi komprehensif ke arsitektur QPS memberikan perubahan mencolok pada tabiat perilaku bot. Reduksi drastis frekuensi perdagangan—dari 1.676 menjadi 79 trades dalam backtest—membuktikan bahwa selectivity lebih menguntungkan daripada frekuensi eksekusi tinggi pada pasar kripto yang penuh manipulasi. Mekanisme siklus perlindungan Kelly Fractional berhasil memotong drawdown dari 71,28% menjadi 1,87%, membuktikan validitas matematis dari teori Kelly pada konteks trading aset kripto.
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        The comprehensive transformation to QPS architecture produced striking changes in bot behavior. The drastic reduction in trading frequency—from 1,676 to 79 trades in backtest—proves that selectivity is more profitable than high execution frequency in manipulation-prone crypto markets. The Kelly Fractional protection cycle successfully reduced drawdown from 71.28% to 1.87%, validating the mathematical validity of Kelly theory in cryptocurrency trading contexts.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <h3 class="subsection-title">4.6 Methodological Limitations <span class="en-subtitle">/ 4.6 Methodological Limitations</span></h3>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Implementasi awal QPS Fase 5.0 mengandung kepincangan metodologi yang wajib diakui. Ambang kritis seperti penolakan OBI di 0,40, batas volatilitas 0,085%, dan multiplier ATR 3,0×, ditetapkan berdasarkan asumsi kualitatif awal—bukan hasil analisis distribusi statistik empiris. Lebih jauh, metrik OBI yang diterapkan hanyalah proksi likuiditas dangkal berbasis level-1 order book (sekadar best bid/ask), jauh dari klaim agregasi institusional kedalaman penuh. Tidak ada tahapan walk-forward validation formal yang menjamin kelayakan parameter sebelum dilepas ke lingkungan live.
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        The initial QPS Phase 5.0 implementation harbored serious methodological flaws. Critical thresholds such as the 0.40 OBI cutoff, 0.085% volatility limit, and 3.0x ATR multiplier were established based on qualitative assumptions—not empirical statistical distribution analysis. Furthermore, the OBI metric was a shallow liquidity proxy based on the level-1 order book (merely best bid/ask), far from claims of full-depth institutional aggregation. No formal walk-forward validation stages vetted parameter viability before live release.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <h3 class="subsection-title">4.7 Multi-Coin Scalping and Auto-Recovery Significance <span class="en-subtitle">/ 4.7 Multi-Coin Scalping and Auto-Recovery Significance</span></h3>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Ekspansi dari single-coin (BTC/USDT) ke pemantauan 100+ koin secara simultan merepresentasikan lompatan paradigmatik fundamental. Klasifikasi volatilitas dinamis (EXTREME/HYPER/HIGH/LOW) memungkinkan kalibrasi parameter keluar posisi secara adaptif per aset, mengeliminasi kelemahan pendekatan one-size-fits-all. Bug WebSocket deadlock yang muncul pada proses parsing 400+ koin serentak berhasil diatasi melalui refaktorisasi arsitektur pre-parsing payload sebelum akuisisi write lock pada modul get.rs (Hendershott et al., 2014; Hasbrouck, 2018).
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        The expansion from single-coin (BTC/USDT) to simultaneous monitoring of 100+ coins represents a fundamental paradigmatic leap. Dynamic volatility classification (EXTREME/HYPER/HIGH/LOW) enables adaptive exit parameter calibration per asset, eliminating the one-size-fits-all approach weakness. The WebSocket deadlock bug arising during concurrent parsing of 400+ coins was resolved through architectural refactoring of pre-parsing payload before write lock acquisition in the get.rs module (Hendershott et al., 2014; Hasbrouck, 2018).
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Penambahan mekanisme QPS Auto-Recovery secara fundamental mengubah filosofi pengelolaan risiko sistem. Alih-alih paradigma binary on/off yang rentan menyebabkan deadlock operasional, sistem kini mengadopsi pendekatan graceful degradation: selalu beroperasi pada kapasitas minimum ($5,05/trade) saat kinerja buruk, lalu secara gradual memulihkan alokasi modal ketika Sharpe Ratio kembali positif. Ini mencerminkan prinsip anti-fragility dalam desain sistem keuangan (Taleb, 2018; Thorp, 2017).
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        The addition of the QPS Auto-Recovery mechanism fundamentally changes the system's risk management philosophy. Instead of a binary on/off paradigm prone to operational deadlock, the system now adopts a graceful degradation approach: always operating at minimum capacity ($5.05/trade) during poor performance, then gradually restoring capital allocation as the Sharpe Ratio returns positive. This reflects the principle of anti-fragility in financial system design (Taleb, 2018; Thorp, 2017).
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. Conclusion & References -->
            <div class="article-section-content" id="sec-5">
                <h2 class="section-title">CONCLUSION <span class="en-title">/ CONCLUSION</span></h2>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Penelitian ini membuktikan bahwa pendekatan indikator statis teknikal konvensional tidak lagi memadai di pasar kripto modern yang dipenuhi manipulasi likuiditas. Penerapan kerangka Quant Professional System (QPS) berbasis Quarter Kelly Criterion dan Sharpe Ratio terbukti secara matematis mengurangi risiko kebangkrutan sambil meningkatkan kualitas sinyal secara signifikan. Ekspansi ke arsitektur multi-koin Fase 5.2 membuka cakupan peluang pasar yang jauh lebih luas, meskipun hasil live jangka panjang masih memerlukan validasi lebih lanjut di berbagai kondisi pasar.
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        This research proves that conventional static technical indicator approaches are no longer sufficient in modern crypto markets filled with liquidity manipulation. The implementation of the Quant Professional System (QPS) framework based on Quarter Kelly Criterion and Sharpe Ratio is mathematically proven to reduce ruin risk while significantly improving signal quality. The expansion to the Phase 5.2 multi-coin architecture opens a much wider market opportunity scope, although long-term live results still require further validation across various market conditions.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-pair">
                    <p class="p-id">
                        Agenda penelitian ke depan mencakup: (1) implementasi OBI multi-level (depth 5–20) sebagai pengganti proksi level-1; (2) kalibrasi parameter berbasis analisis distribusi persentil empiris (walk-forward optimization); (3) integrasi sentiment analysis berbasis data sosial media sebagai konfirmator tambahan; dan (4) pengujian lintas-pasangan selain BTC/USDT untuk memvalidasi universalitas kerangka QPS.
                    </p>
                    <p class="p-en">
                        Future research agenda includes: (1) implementation of multi-level OBI (depth 5–20) as a replacement for the level-1 proxy; (2) parameter calibration based on empirical percentile distribution analysis (walk-forward optimization); (3) integration of social media-based sentiment analysis as an additional confirmator; and (4) cross-pair testing beyond BTC/USDT to validate the universality of the QPS framework.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

